     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">256 == 513</code> is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">False</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">256 &lt; 513</code> is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">True</code>, so the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">elif</code> branch is taken and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Body 2</code> executes. <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">513 &gt;= 512</code> is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">True</code>, so <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Body 3</code> executes."
